    "detailed_description": "<h1>Collaboration</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm Stones</strong> has a collaboration with\u00a0<strong>A Dance of Fire and Ice</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out the collaboration song in Rhythm Stones!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Rhythm Stones is a 1 button 3D rhythm game that crosses moving stepping stones.</strong><br><br><br><strong>1. Cross the 3D stepping stones to the beat!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones is a 3D rhythm game in which you cross the moving stepping stones to the beat. The stepping stones move in various types of 3D space; flat, cylindrical, spherical, and random!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>2. Simple controls, but hardcore difficulty!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones lets you press any key to play, but can you get past all of the difficult beats until the end?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>3. But even if you fail, special items allow you to succeed over time!</strong><br><br>The more you lose a level, the more health-increasing items appear. No matter how difficult the stage is, if you keep trying you will surely succeed!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>4. Enjoy 56 songs in various genres!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones consists of 56 stages (including 5 tutorials), and each stage consists of a different song in various genres such as rock, funk, jazz, EDM, acoustic, etc.<br><br><br><strong>\u203b Game Tip</strong> <br><br>Rhythm monsters help you know the next beat, so it's very important to memorize each rhythm monster's pattern. In particular, the black rhythm monster (8th note) and the green rhythm monster (quarter note) appear the most!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/1a766e057db44e5d544723ef572f811c.avif?t=1729048501\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Rhythm Stones is a 1 button 3D rhythm game that crosses moving stepping stones.</strong><br><br><br><strong>1. Cross the 3D stepping stones to the beat!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones is a 3D rhythm game in which you cross the moving stepping stones to the beat. The stepping stones move in various types of 3D space; flat, cylindrical, spherical, and random!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/fe1bc17b5a9b915e6bfad9b55c2337d9.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>2. Simple controls, but hardcore difficulty!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones lets you press any key to play, but can you get past all of the difficult beats until the end?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/9474782cd9b94949ed54c0e85d59f5ad.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>3. But even if you fail, special items allow you to succeed over time!</strong><br><br>The more you lose a level, the more health-increasing items appear. No matter how difficult the stage is, if you keep trying you will surely succeed!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.poster.avif?t=1729048501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.webm?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/89f828844e383db638dc37ade1b9c964.mp4?t=1729048501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>4. Enjoy 56 songs in various genres!</strong><br><br>Rhythm Stones consists of 56 stages (including 5 tutorials), and each stage consists of a different song in various genres such as rock, funk, jazz, EDM, acoustic, etc.<br><br><br><strong>\u203b Game Tip</strong> <br><br>Rhythm monsters help you know the next beat, so it's very important to memorize each rhythm monster's pattern. In particular, the black rhythm monster (8th note) and the green rhythm monster (quarter note) appear the most!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175450/extras/1a766e057db44e5d544723ef572f811c.avif?t=1729048501\" /></div>",
